      "title": "Food Ordering Website",
      "description": "This ASP.NET-based Food Ordering System streamlines restaurant operations with full user and admin management, order tracking, and secure payment integration. Built using C#, SQL, and HTML/Bootstrap, it allows customers to register, browse menus, and place orders efficiently. The system enhances customer experience and restaurant productivity with real-time notifications, automated workflows, and comprehensive reporting tools. Future enhancements may include mobile app integration, AI-driven recommendations, and advanced analytics for better decision-making.",
